                                  Data="M 17.5,2.5 C 18.1,1.9 19.1,1.9 19.7,2.5 L 21.5,4.3 C 22.1,4.9 22.1,5.9 21.5,6.5 L 8.5,19.5 L 3,21 L 4.5,15.5 Z M 15,5 L 19,9 M 5,16 L 8,19"
