                                  Data="M 7,18 L 2.5,13.5 C 1.8,12.8 1.8,11.7 2.5,11 L 11.5,2 C 12.2,1.3 13.3,1.3 14,2 L 21.5,9.5 C 22.2,10.2 22.2,11.3 21.5,12 L 13.5,20 L 7,20 Z M 6,13 L 14.5,4.5"
